//-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Used Entities :
//-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// e-fast_uri-     : Uri for Cached site
// e-site_mcomm-   : Multi position site to load arrobas
// e-site_uri-     : Url for non cached
// e-arroba_jtype- : Arroba Jtype - Json generated base in arroba path
// e-theme_data-   : Theme class to manage content && html
